title: Joseph Wirth
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, left
view-if: wirth_advisor = 1
card-image: img/portraits/wirth.jpg
new-page: true 

= Joseph Wirth

Wirth is a former chancellor and figure of the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span> who has been devotedly <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span>. He is a strong supporter of maintaining democracy and building a broad popular base for the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?].

- @spd_relation
- @building_left
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@spd_relation
title: Build ties with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>
subtitle: Wirth is viewed favourably within the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>, and can help foster relations.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: spd_relation += 10

The SPD appreciates our olive branch.

@building_left
title: Building the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span>
subtitle: Push the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] to the left.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if peoples_party_support > 4: There is already substantial support for a People's Party. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 15

Wirth rallies the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span> and uses his positions in the party to increase its influence. This has caused concern in the right of the party.

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Müller" : Müller must be Chancellor. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and chancellor == "Müller"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12;

@support_interconfessionalism
title: Supporting Interconfessionalism
subtitle: Can we expand our party's scope beyond the Catholic faith?
view-if: interconfessionalism_support <= 3
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
